program	errors/partial_move_field.saw
triple	arm64-apple-darwin
twin	same
expect	error
build	refused	cannot move out of field `x` of `p`
meets_expect	yes
log	"error: cannot move out of field `x` of `p`"
log	"  --> examples/errors/partial_move_field.saw:13:13"
log	"     |"
log	" 13 |     let z = move p.x"
log	"     |             ^"
log	"   hint: move the whole value (`move p`) or restructure so the piece is its own binding; a field moves out with `p.x.take()`, which leaves a valid value behind"
log	""
log	"error: undefined variable `z`"
log	"  --> examples/errors/partial_move_field.saw:14:11"
log	"     |"
log	" 14 |     print(z)"
log	"     |           ^"
log	""
log	"2 error(s) generated"
